### Cambiar la ubicación on-job por coordenadas — resultado esperado (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/changeOnJobLocation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobId": 1,
  "latitude": 14.634915,
  "longitude": -90.506882
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/changeOnJobLocation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobId": 1,
  "latitude": 14.634915,
  "longitude": -90.506882
}

### Validación: sin jobId → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/changeOnJobLocation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": 14.634915,
  "longitude": -90.506882
}

### Validación: jobId menor o igual a 0 → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/changeOnJobLocation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobId": 0,
  "latitude": 14.634915,
  "longitude": -90.506882
}
